---
source: crates/rattler-bin/src/main.rs
expression: redact(subcommand.render_long_help().to_string())
---
Install menu items for an installed package

Usage: rattler install-menu [OPTIONS] <PACKAGE_NAME>

Arguments:
  <PACKAGE_NAME>
          Name of the package for which to install menu items

Options:
  -p, --prefix <TARGET_PREFIX>
          Target prefix (environment path) to look for the package
          
          [default: .prefix]
          [alias: --target-prefix]

  -v, --verbose
          Log verbose

      --offline
          Disable network access and use only locally cached data

  -h, --help
          Print help
